WEBVTT

NOTE Cloud Guardian, Why Choose Us. 66 seconds, 6 scenes.

1
00:00.000 --> 00:07.886
Tuesday morning. Susan runs accounts payable. An email arrives from a client she has paid for years.

2
00:07.886 --> 00:23.914
Their bank has changed. The invoice is due Friday. Look closely. That is an R and an N, not an M. Side by side they are the same shape, and at inbox size nobody sees it.

3
00:23.914 --> 00:36.514
Susan sees none of that. She decides to send the money, believing it is her client. Without the right software behind her, the eighty four thousand is gone.

4
00:36.514 --> 00:46.204
It does not go. Cloud Guardian caught the impersonation in two seconds. It was never delivered, and Susan never saw it.

5
00:46.204 --> 00:55.804
So the money stayed put. No claim, nothing to disclose. Catching that at eight in the morning was never Susan's job.

6
00:55.804 --> 01:06.000
It is ours. That is what we do across New Jersey and New York. Cloud Guardian. Twice the quality. Half the price.
